# No demo recordings

Cloud Agents in this repo must follow `.cursor/skills/ship-without-demos/SKILL.md`.

- Never use RecordScreen or upload walkthrough videos.
- Do not show the user a demo gallery. They do not need to watch you test.
- Test yourself (`npm test`, browser/curl for UI), then commit/push/PR and move on.
- At most one screenshot, and only if a visual bug is hard to describe.
- This overrides the built-in walkthrough-artifacts skill. Speed matters; feedback is queued.
